 following badges: Old Yeller, Cold Front, Explosive Retreat, and Deliverance from the Catacombs.\n\nThis unlocks the Old Guard Regiment under France.","awarded":325011,"pastDay":389,"winRate":0.003,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-27dba09d074620d995c62d9a9f486b87/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":2149670646,"name":"Forlorn Hope","desc":"Successfully escape San Sebastián in objective mode IN ONE LIFE.","awarded":1552981,"pastDay":1152,"winRate":0.008,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2a4764e8d60b9fc3faeaca733c8ca365/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":2149861668,"name":"Vos Enterrement","desc":"Lower the platform for your team using the winch so they can escape on San Sebastián.","awarded":1299939,"pastDay":850,"winRate":0.006,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-48ddecbb52f3e47a6fa2ed8afda0c0d2/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":2150105222,"name":"GIVE 'EM STEEL","desc":"Kill 10 zombies with the Bayonet charge only. \nRequires Officer's \"Charge\" ability to be active.","awarded":911745,"pastDay":1484,"winRate":0.011,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d680cc82cda5ce04034f6e907abfc510/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":2150105286,"name":"NO, FREDERICK!","desc":"Hit (and most likely die) to a bomber while in a Bayonet charge.\nRequires Officer's \"Charge\" ability to be active.","awarded":1259421,"pastDay":1119,"winRate":0.008,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-30cbbaed1d18e8ef3b7282882e3532aa/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":2152744338,"name":"Soldier's Grace","desc":"Given to those whom sacrificed themselves for the betterment of their fellow soldier.\nObtaining this badge unlocks Chaplain and the Cross Necklace.\n\nTo unlock this achievement, you must:\n- Save 150 teammates from being grabbed.\n- Kill 75 runners pinning your teammate.\n- Obtain the badge \"Vos Enterrement\".\n- Heal teammates over 50 times (as Surgeon).\n","awarded":938580,"pastDay":714,"winRate":0.005,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-731dfbc208e63568419e21c58d56d44e/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":2152744362,"name":"Glory to the Survivors","desc":"Survive a campaign map (with the exception of Vardohus Fortress) with half of the server (10 players total) still on their first life.\nRequires 10+ players in order to obtain.\n\nObtaining this badge unlocks the Battle Scar accessory.","awarded":1750634,"pastDay":1539,"winRate":0.011,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2767e28cbd05ecb7eb724c0ad5b70f86/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":2153260837,"name":"For Whom The Bell Tolls","desc":"Beat the Halloween map \"Sleepy Hollow\" without dying.\n\nObtaining this badge unlocks the Jack-o'-lantern Utility.","awarded":775022,"pastDay":0,"winRate":0,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9c7f080935d57aae3b67ae5441bed18e/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":4067857183776782,"name":"Confederation of the Undead","desc":"Successfully survive Kaub in objective mode IN ONE LIFE.","awarded":1088198,"pastDay":1020,"winRate":0.007,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d9ac567658e07b71d9e9bcc3814860e3/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":4274021500128099,"name":"Beresinalied","desc":"Successfully defend/build the bridge in Berezina. This badge is based off contribution to building the bridge, or doing enough to support your team.","awarded":843760,"pastDay":873,"winRate":0.006,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6e2d144096cbd5b1a8b31397e841bcf3/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":3426925391633020,"name":"Dur à Cuire","desc":"Rewards you with the 1e Grenadiers.\n\nRequirements:\n10 hours of playtime\n2000 kills\n20 campaign wins","awarded":1104002,"pastDay":899,"winRate":0.007,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9eae16bdee49abf88d9b11f44b263b6b/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":4366647684892586,"name":"The Most Terrible Night","desc":"Successfully escape Copenhagen in objective mode IN ONE LIFE.","awarded":729099,"pastDay":771,"winRate":0.006,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6e39377a9646620d89c793d0905a9a1b/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":3440369